      "id": "claim_0dfeb7a062d04e0396cd4a8f89b31a2a",
      "statement": "A cached vp task sees only a built-in environment: a build reading an env var must be a task declaring env (scripts cannot), env fingerprints the value rather than what it points at (workshop-backend's build is cache:false because FORMAT_BLUEPRINTS_DIR names a path outside the workspace), and a task that reads a path it also writes never caches — frontend dist and vitest/wrangler scratch paths must be excluded from input, with gatekeeper SPA exclusions workspace-wide or gatekeepers invalidate each other.",
