      "statement": "Repo-wide tooling rules: one recursive tsc under TypeScript 7 with singleThreaded:true (measured fastest and smallest), no incremental tsconfigs (tsbuildinfo would de-cache the type check for a net loss), no root script calling pnpm run --recursive, scripts/assert-workerd.ts must stay in workerd-pool setupFiles so a failed vitest-pool-workers start fails the suite, and lint is oxlint via vp lint configured in the root vite.config.ts with correctness+suspicious as errors, a repo-local gadgets/prefer-jsdoc rule, and the integration-tests capnweb import restriction.",
